@@ -228,6 +228,12 @@ class Context:
         value is not set, it defaults to the value from the parent
         context. ``Command.show_default`` overrides this default for the
         specific command.
+    :param cleanup_timeout: maximum time, in seconds, to wait for
+        cleanup operations (registered with :meth:`call_on_close` and
+        :meth:`with_resource`) to complete when :meth:`close` is called.
+        If the timeout is exceeded, cleanup is interrupted to prevent
+        hanging teardown. A value of ``None`` (the default) disables the
